Description: The alphagraph package provides a graphical multiple comparison tool for 
    visualizing and interpreting the results of multiple comparisons in 
    statistical analyses. It offers an intuitive interface for comparing 
    groups and understanding the relationships between them, making it easier 
    to identify significant differences and patterns in the data.
